{
  "title": "Kissed Spicy Korean Chicken Dosirak",
  "description": "A winey, juicy, weeknight Korean dish featuring hot chilli powder, robata-grill, and macrobiotic-friendly ingredients, served in a dosirak format.",
  "cuisine": "Korean",
